= Introduction
Introduction: In the year 2030, the Earth decided it had enough. It wasn't just global warming; it was a full-scale geological rebellion. Our protagonist, Dr. Aris (a brilliant but anxious geologist), is trying to warn the world's richest man, a tech tycoon named Leon Husk (a fictional parody), about the impending doom.
